6vj|n|In front of; preceding in space; ahead of; as, to stand before the fire; before the house. ; Preceding in time; earlier than; previously to; anterior to the time when; -- sometimes with the additional idea of purpose; in order that. ; An advance of; farther onward, in place or time. ; Prior or preceding in dignity, order, rank, right, or worth; rather than. ; In presence or sight of; face to face with; facing. ; Under the cognizance or jurisdiction of. ; Open for; free of access to; in the power of.	V:lmr,21,1;1zyk,4,1~lmr,21,1;1zyk,4,1	N:11tr,16,7~11tr,16,7
